    "title": "Braasch Avenue, 3rd Street intersection to close for two days - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Press Release ,\n1 days ago NORFOLK, Neb. — Drivers in downtown Norfolk will need to find another route early next week as work continues on the Illuminate River Point project. The intersection of Braasch Avenue and 3rd Street will be closed Monday, Sept. 28, and Tuesday, Sept. 29, while crews work on festoon lighting for the project. Read full article",
